 a VR app that takes you from an immersive listening experience to a transformative, in-person, awakening journey.\n\nYOUR EXPERIENCE...\n\nSPARKS OF THOUGHTS\nHand picked stories that will elevate your consciousness\n\nBITS OF CONNECTION\nVirtual connectedness with subject matter experts around the world\n\nTINGLES OF REALIZATION\nAttend in-person holistic workshops, retreats and training\n\nHOW KAJI WORKS...\n\nLISTEN\nTo authentic, inspiring, ancient wisdom and psychology-based stories.\n\nENGAGE\nBy experiencing virtual connectedness via online classes and workshops.\n\nACT\nBy expanding your reach, attending in-person retreats, events & training.\n", "short_description": "THE SELF AWAKENING APPS that encourage you to disconnect"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kaji.life/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.kaji.life/tos", "publisher_name": "KAJI", "support_website_url": "https://kaji.life/contact-us", "website_url": "https://kaji.life/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "RELAXATION_MEDITATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1464141654060875"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031375_5154148247980603_7109913255964386033_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F